&lt;/section></description></item><item><title>Comment</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/comment/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/comment/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>comment&lt;/code> shortcode hides content from the rendered output. It acts as an invisible annotation — useful for leaving notes in Markdown that readers won&amp;rsquo;t see.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; comment &amp;gt;}}This text is hidden from the rendered page.{{&amp;lt; /comment &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Example:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Visible text before the comment. Visible text after the comment.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The text between the &lt;code>comment&lt;/code> shortcode tags above is not rendered. View the page source to confirm.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Card</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/card/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/card/</guid><description>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{% card header=&amp;#34;Card Header&amp;#34; title=&amp;#34;Card title&amp;#34; footer=&amp;#34;Card footer&amp;#34; %}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Card body content here.
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{% /card %}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Example:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted -->
&lt;p>This is a rendered Docsy &lt;code>card&lt;/code> shortcode.&lt;/p>
&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --></description></item><item><title>Conditional Text</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/conditional-text/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/conditional-text/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>conditional-text&lt;/code> shortcode renders content only when the &lt;code>include-if&lt;/code> value matches the site&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code>params.buildCondition&lt;/code>. This is useful for showing content specific to certain build environments or feature flags.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; conditional-text include-if=&amp;#34;examples&amp;#34; &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>This text only appears when buildCondition is set to &amp;#34;examples&amp;#34;.
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{&amp;lt; /conditional-text &amp;gt;}}
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Parameters:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;table>
 &lt;thead>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
 &lt;th>Default&lt;/th>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/thead>
 &lt;tbody>
 &lt;tr>
 &lt;td>&lt;code>include-if&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>Condition string to match against &lt;code>params.buildCondition&lt;/code>&lt;/td>
 &lt;td>&lt;em>(required)&lt;/em>&lt;/td>
 &lt;/tr>
 &lt;/tbody>
&lt;/table>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Example:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>

This sentence is rendered because `params.buildCondition` is set to `examples`.

&lt;p>If the text above is not visible, the site&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code>params.buildCondition&lt;/code> does not match &lt;code>&amp;quot;examples&amp;quot;&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Cardpane</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/cardpane/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/content-formatting-examples/docsy/cardpane/</guid><description>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>{{% cardpane %}}
